    "summary": "Blessed are the righteous—The ungodly will perish.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Blessed is the man that walketh not in the counsel of the ungodly, nor standeth in the way of sinners, nor sitteth in the seat of the scornful.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 7,
            "text": "TG Happiness."
          },
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "Prov. 1:10 (10–19); Eph. 5:11 (8–13)."
          },
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 50,
            "text": "TG Counselor."
          },
          {
            "start": 134,
            "end": 142,
            "text": "Ps. 26:4; Jer. 15:17."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 10
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "But his delight is in the law of the Lord; and in his law doth he meditate day and night.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "TG Abundant Life."
          },
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "HEB teaching, direction, doctrine. TG God, Law of."
          },
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 74,
            "text": "TG Meditation."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 18
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "And he shall be like a tree planted by the rivers of water, that bringeth forth his fruit in his season; his leaf also shall not wither; and whatsoever he doeth shall prosper.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "Jer. 17:8 (7–8)."
          },
          {
            "start": 167,
            "end": 174,
            "text": "Gen. 39:3 (2–3); Mosiah 1:7; Alma 50:20; Hel. 12:1; D&C 9:13."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The ungodly are not so: but are like the chaff which the wind driveth away.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 46,
            "text": "Job 21:18 (17–18); Ps. 83:13 (2, 13); Hosea 13:3 (1–4); Morm. 5:16 (16–18)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 15
          },
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 31
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore the ungodly shall not stand in the judgment, nor sinners in the congregation of the righteous.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For the Lord knoweth the way of the righteous: but the way of the ungodly shall perish.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "TG Righteousness."
          },
          {
